In windows, Goto C Drive -&gt; Java folder -&gt; jdk folder -&gt; bin
In Ubuntu, Goto usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-amd64/bin/
there you will find keytool
Type cmd in the address bar as shown below:

Command prompt window will open from that path

Type this in command prompt and run it. Notice we are explicitly forcing both the keystore
password (-storepass) and the individual key entry password (-keypass) to be identical
(mypassword):
